Error: Jet.CheckedTextHoleSlot: `process.Sh` refuses this hole's type where it sits
  --> Tests/UI/sh_head_rejects_list_hole.jet:5:23
    |
  5 |     listed: Sh{"echo {items}"}
    |                       ^^^^^
 Why: A list (`[String]`) cannot sit in one `Sh` hole because `Sh` keeps each hole as one argv item without splitting; use `.extend(items)` instead
 Fix: Pass a value of a type this place accepts, or move the hole to a place that accepts its type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.CheckedTextHoleSlot
